<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nī^gresco</span></b> , grŭi,
		3, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. inch.
				n.</i> (usu. ī) [id.], <i>to become
				black, grow dark</i> (<b>poet.</b> and
			post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">latices nigrescere sacros, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 454</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tenebris nigrescere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 11, 824</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigrescunt sanguine venae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 3, 503</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">baca incipiens nigrescere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 1, 2, § 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigrescens cutis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 26,
					1, 5, § 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nigrescentes dentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					31, 10, 46, § 117</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bacae cum jam nigruerint,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 48</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dies nigrescet,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Ezech. 30, 18</span></i>
			.</div>
